<metadata><name>Day 16 - River &amp; Ruin, Squire Cleaver, River &amp; Ruin, River &amp; Ruin, Dan Welsh</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.429065" lon="-79.927324"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Twiss Road at No 8 Sideroad</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.422197" lon="-79.917272"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the main Bruce Trail, heading south-east. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.420864" lon="-79.915332"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.423680" lon="-79.914157"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Dan Welsh Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.423319" lon="-79.915053"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.425893" lon="-79.912981"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Squire Cleaver Side Trail, heading west. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.426143" lon="-79.915682"><name>J6</name><desc>J6: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.428316" lon="-79.914013"><name>J7</name><desc>J7: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail (low water), heading west. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.427527" lon="-79.915398"><name>J8</name><desc>J8: Turn sharp right onto the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail, heading north. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.422720" lon="-79.915459"><name>J9</name><desc>J9: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail (high water), heading south-west. (the blue-blazed River &amp; Ruin Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
